<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Probe Points</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description: Probe points</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">are single points or stream of points captured by the arm. A probe point represents the co-ordinates of centre of the arm probe at the time of capturing.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Capture Static Points</span> <span lang="EN-GB">or</span> <span class="Command">Capture Dynamic Points</span> <span lang="EN-GB">commands from Scan Data Menu to generate probe points.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
